#: ui/main.qml:28
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "Legacy X11 apps with global shortcuts and other features accessed while running in the background need to be able to listen for keystrokes all the time.<nl/><nl/>If you use any of these apps, you can choose your preferred balance of security and compatibility here."
msgstr "Starije X11 aplikacije s globalnim prečacima i drugim značajkama dostupnima u pozadini moraju stalno moći osluškivati pritiske tipki.<nl/><nl/>Ako koristite takve aplikacije, ovdje odaberite željenu ravnotežu između sigurnosti i kompatibilnosti."

#: ui/main.qml:49
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Listening for keystrokes:"
msgstr "Osluškivanje pritisaka tipki:"

#: ui/main.qml:52
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio Listening for keystrokes is prohibited"
msgid "Prohibited"
msgstr "Zabranjeno"

#: ui/main.qml:61
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "Most secure; global shortcuts will not work in X11 apps"
msgstr "Najsigurnije; globalni prečaci neće raditi u X11 aplikacijama"

#: ui/main.qml:67
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio Listening for keystrokes is allowed for…"
msgid "Only the Meta, Control, Alt, and Shift keys"
msgstr "Samo tipke Meta, Control, Alt i Shift"

#: ui/main.qml:76
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "High security; push-to-talk and other modifier-only global shortcuts will work in X11 apps"
msgstr "Visoka razina sigurnosti; u X11 aplikacijama radit će prečaci koji koriste samo modifikatorske tipke, poput pritisni-za-govor"

#: ui/main.qml:81
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio Listening for keystrokes is allowed for…"
msgid "As above, plus any key pressed while the Control, Alt, or Meta key is also pressed"
msgstr "Kao gore, uz bilo koju tipku pritisnutu zajedno s tipkom Control, Alt ili Meta"

#: ui/main.qml:90
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "Moderate security; all global shortcuts will work in X11 apps"
msgstr "Umjerena razina sigurnosti; svi globalni prečaci radit će u X11 aplikacijama"

#: ui/main.qml:96
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio Listening for keystrokes is always allowed"
msgid "Always allowed"
msgstr "Uvijek dopušteno"

#: ui/main.qml:105
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "Least secure; all X11 apps will be able to see any text you type into any application"
msgstr "Najmanje sigurno; sve X11 aplikacije moći će vidjeti tekst koji upisujete u bilo koju aplikaciju"

#: ui/main.qml:111
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "Note that using this setting will reduce system security and permit malicious software to steal passwords and spy on the text that you type. Make sure you understand and accept this risk."
msgstr "Imajte na umu da ova postavka smanjuje sigurnost sustava i zlonamjernom softveru omogućuje krađu lozinki i praćenje teksta koji upisujete. Provjerite razumijete li i prihvaćate taj rizik."

#: ui/main.qml:118
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Listening for mouse buttons:"
msgstr "Osluškivanje tipki miša:"

#: ui/main.qml:121
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio Listening for mouse buttons is allowed"
msgid "Allowed"
msgstr "Dopušteno"

#: ui/main.qml:130
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "Moderate security; global shortcuts involving mouse buttons will work in X11 apps"
msgstr "Umjerena razina sigurnosti; globalni prečaci koji uključuju tipke miša radit će u X11 aplikacijama"

#: ui/main.qml:141
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:group"
msgid "Control of pointer and keyboard:"
msgstr "Upravljanje pokazivačem i tipkovnicom:"

#: ui/main.qml:146
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:check Allowed control of pointer and keyboard without asking for permissions for allowed apps"
msgid "Allowed apps"
msgstr "Dopuštene aplikacije"

#: ui/main.qml:156
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "See Allowed Applications…"
msgstr "Prikaži dopuštene aplikacije…"

#: ui/main.qml:160
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window title of the page opened by the 'See allowed applications' button"
msgid "Applications allowed to control the pointer and keyboard"
msgstr "Aplikacije kojima je dopušteno upravljati pokazivačem i tipkovnicom"

#: ui/main.qml:165
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "See Denied Applications…"
msgstr "Prikaži zabranjene aplikacije…"

#: ui/main.qml:169
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@title:window title of the page opened by the 'See denied applications' button"
msgid "Applications never allowed to control the pointer and keyboard"
msgstr "Aplikacije kojima nikad nije dopušteno upravljati pokazivačem i tipkovnicom"

#: ui/main.qml:178
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "Moderate security; XWayland-using apps claiming to be something on this list will be able to take control of the computer, because XWayland-using apps’ identities can’t be verified"
msgstr "Umjerena razina sigurnosti; aplikacije koje koriste XWayland i predstavljaju se kao aplikacije s ovog popisa moći će preuzeti kontrolu nad računalom jer se njihov identitet ne može provjeriti"

#: ui/main.qml:184
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@option:radio Allow control of pointer and keyboard without asking for permission"
msgid "Allow without asking for permission"
msgstr "Dopusti bez traženja dopuštenja"

#: ui/main.qml:193
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "Least secure; all X11 apps will be able to take control of the computer"
msgstr "Najmanje sigurno; sve X11 aplikacije moći će preuzeti kontrolu nad računalom"

#: ui/main.qml:200
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid "Note that using this setting will drastically reduce system security and permit malicious software to take complete control of your pointer and keyboard. Make sure you understand and accept this risk."
msgstr "Imajte na umu da ova postavka znatno smanjuje sigurnost sustava i zlonamjernom softveru omogućuje potpuno upravljanje pokazivačem i tipkovnicom. Provjerite razumijete li i prihvaćate taj rizik."

#: ui/main.qml:229
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip %1 is the name of the app/binary"
msgid "Do not allow %1 to control the pointer and keyboard without asking"
msgstr "Nemoj dopustiti aplikaciji %1 upravljanje pokazivačem i tipkovnicom bez pitanja"